      <p class="hero-desc">
        Around 88% of the UAE's population are expats. Yet most people facing divorce here still miss the one decision that matters most: where to divorce, not just how. This is the pillar guide for non-Muslim expats and mixed-nationality couples: the dual-law system after the 2022 and 2024 reforms, the home-country-law opt-in, the forum choice that decides your financial outcome, and the process in Abu Dhabi vs Dubai. Written for British, Indian, American and other expats who want real information, not a law firm brochure.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-author">By <strong>Aleksi Suoninen</strong> · UAE Expat &amp; Legal Consultant · divorceu.ae</p>
